      "inReaderQuoteSHA256": {
        "it is you who are in need of Allah": "8a4171f66d62dfed5a37cdd5a17243bf94237e639728d4f267b2800f48587056",
        "In Your Name, O my Lord, I place my side (on the bed), and by You I will lift it.": "ac144f5f6093f20137537952ee4b894aae50b39cbc09172e0b0172433559a401",
        "O Allah, by You we have reached the morning, and by You we have reached the evening; by You we live, and by You we die": "b11c145fa3adad9500aa02d5d86b1207f1bd9a5dfe12851c0d4fa37595998761",
        "My (power as well as existence) is due to Thee (Thine grace) and I turn to Thee (for supplication).": "d45598d1a206241a6ef971d7f1a8726dc4ab2feb9ba324293c64f6cedbd6edd4",
        "There is no might and no power except with Allah.": "74bd6f98870eb8965705b1d1fa37fbaebff3be0dbafb8579d832d13ed0c61ec8",
        "All praise is due to Allah who fed me this and granted it as provision to me, without any effort from me nor power": "634b3faceafbd0305d88d69716c92864ce0f3f5844cd9432064365d7dfa40787",
        "Indeed, man transgresses\nwhen he deems himself to be self-sufficient.": "6c62efe4c2a16f447135837f48f5dcccae2188e64885f19a68660ef5ef4bfa40",
        "whereas Allah is the Self-Sufficient, the Praiseworthy.": "443532a535aa68e5633ccfb97465f49f43713d71b47b6b1f2197ee8ae17da0c7",
        "There is no spot, the size of four fingers in them, except that there is an angel placing his forehead in it, prostrating to Allah.": "5a12345b4f2361cf870ce1d95d264c2935a0bf00a4c56e9cd8099633dd9380f5"
      }
    },
